From 30303ee8fd669e88a102ffa5e2d90de91172a0d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaseyW <zkpowergrind@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:58:19 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] add Beast Sound animation_url to token_uri

Optional sound page contract (owner-set, zero = unchanged token_uri). When set,
token_uri hands the JSON members and SVG base64 to the page, which returns the
full token_uri with an animation_url that plays the Beast's theme.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
